"That's it! You can do the same in a chat, email, or document." = "就是这样！在聊天、邮件或文档的输入框里，也可以这样输入。";
"No result was delivered. Check the microphone and model, then try again." = "这次没有成功输出结果，请检查麦克风和模型后再试一次。";
"First, drag to select the sample." = "先拖动鼠标，选中右侧的示例文字。";
"Use the shortcut below to begin." = "使用下面的快捷键开始体验。";
"Hold shortcuts: release to finish. Tap or double-tap shortcuts: use Finish Speaking below." = "长按模式松开即可结束；单击或双击模式可点击下方「说完了」。";
"Hold to speak: release to finish. Otherwise, tap %@ or choose Finish Speaking." = "长按模式松开即可结束；其他模式可单击 %@ 或点击「说完了」。";
"Finish Speaking" = "说完了";
"Microphone Level" = "麦克风音量";
"Select this sample" = "选中这段示例";
"Your Result" = "你的翻译结果";
"Read this aloud" = "照着读一句";
"Your words will appear here" = "你说的话会出现在这里";
"Choose a target language different from the sample." = "选择一种与示例不同的目标语言。";
"Enable Translation" = "启用翻译";
"Use Voice Input's Speech Model" = "复用语音输入的识别模型";
"Translation needs a text model. Configure one, or try this later." = "翻译需要文字模型，你可以现在配置，也可以稍后体验。";
"Configure Translation Model" = "配置翻译模型";
"Choose a model for translation. Other features stay unchanged." = "选择用于翻译的模型，其他功能的配置保持不变。";
"Select text and ask Voxt to make it clearer or shorter." = "选中文字，用一句话让 Voxt 改得更清晰、更简洁。";
"Capture a passing thought as a note without opening a document." = "随口记录灵感，不用先打开文档。";
"Record a meeting, review the transcript, and generate a summary." = "记录会议内容，回看转录文字，生成会议摘要。";
"File Transcription" = "文件转录";
"Import an audio or video file and turn it into searchable text." = "导入音视频文件，转换成可以搜索的文字。";
"Open Files from the main window" = "在主窗口中打开「文件」";
"Open Notes from the main window" = "在主窗口中打开「笔记」";
"Try Later" = "稍后体验";
"Less" = "收起";
